  "title": "Tamale Casserole",
  "description": "Canned beef tamales are cut into chunks and combined in a casserole with onion, cheese, tortilla chips and (beanless) chili. These are baked for 40 to 45 minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "Stinger"
  ],
